#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:3
#: f50fc64b3f854396b3483046c5821243
msgid "Prior notifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:5
#: 14b2d9a4782d4c3b9e4d014cf090c138
msgid "Prior notifications (PNOs) of return to port can be monitored, checked, prioritized and sent to control units for targeted land inspections."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:8
#: 79a8ae7ddb844d64b02fba5da72af9e6
msgid "Table of prior notifications of forecoming landings"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:13
#: b5062406c4534fc5a2b7e20522f31f3d
msgid "Sources of prior notifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:15
#: 3d38dff32a9240d8ac1b96c03a35c350
msgid "**logbook PNOs** are sent by vessels in their electronic logbook, and received by the :doc:`flows/sales-and-logbook` flow"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:16
#: 3ad42f3df9974baa8aae504995122a44
msgid "**manual PNOs** are entered by FMC agents (*\"Ajouter un préavis\"*) for vessels which are not subject to electronic logbook, with the expected catches, port and date of arrival. Manual PNOs are also displayed in the vessel's trip."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:19
#: 610b38694d954d21ac1037a678ef5811
msgid "The data pipeline computes the type, :doc:`fleet segments <fleet-segments>` and :doc:`risk factor <risk-factor>` of each PNO (see :doc:`flows/enrich-logbook` and :doc:`flows/init-pno-types`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:23
#: 0f5fdc7f637941a4a83053a69ae00be0
msgid "List of prior notifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:25
#: b32359d9f40b41f68eabd4f243651fca
msgid "The list of PNOs, in the side window, can be filtered by nationality, fleet segment, species, gears, date of the last control, port and expected time of arrival, PNO type, vessel length and sending status. A counter shows the number of PNOs to verify."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:28
#: 667c6ddad7b1408fb95a8cbd89a85892
msgid "The card of each PNO shows its content, the decision of the FMC, the history of messages sent to control units and allows to download the PNO as a PDF document."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:32
#: 1fd9bf17cfab4faba1272d52e792b10f
msgid "Verification and distribution"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:34
#: 84d78723d902489eb6fd344d50a1875c
msgid "PNOs which are in the *verification scope* of the FMC - PNOs of vessels with a high :doc:`risk factor <risk-factor>`, of foreign vessels (except some flag states) or of vessels with active :doc:`reportings` - must be verified by an FMC agent before being sent. By default, the prioritization is based on the :doc:`risk factor <risk-factor>` and can be overridden by FMC supervisors for specific cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:38
#: 4a1f827ee8cd4c5ab68d1efce612c8d2
msgid "other PNOs are sent automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:40
#: 15e6d06d56c04f1d8ef53dc32eeb55c1
msgid "PNOs are sent by email and SMS by the :doc:`flows/distribute-pnos` flow to the control units subscribed to the port, fleet segment or vessel (see :doc:`control-units`). A PNO can be invalidated, for instance when it was sent by mistake."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:43
#: 442d476aa9cc494db047646f72437a9a
msgid "Manual \"zero\" PNOs of BFT and SWO are automatically invalidated after 24 hours."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/prior-notifications.rst:45
#: 851916d581e344aabfaa13a39dbe45e3
msgid "Depending on the deployment, regular users can access the list of prior notifications in read only mode."
msgstr ""
